{
 "encounter_id": "00923",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can't sleep, and my head won't stop racing about work. I'm exhausted, and I came in because I didn't know where else to go at this hour."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm glad you did. Let's sort this out together. How long has the sleep been bad?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About three weeks. I lie awake until four in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What is the worry about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A big project at work, and I've been told there may be redundancies. I can't switch off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing like that. I just need sleep."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good, thank you for telling me. Any panic attacks or chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No panic attacks. No chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I've done his observations. Pulse 88, blood pressure 134 over 86, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 16."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Those are fine, a little up from stress. Do you drink alcohol or coffee?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass or two of wine to wind down. And plenty of coffee, I'm afraid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How much coffee?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six cups a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That will be affecting your sleep. Any medical problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just mild asthma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you tried anything to help you sleep? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really. Camomile tea, which did nothing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me explain what I think is going on. You're under heavy stress, with caffeine and alcohol, and it's keeping your brain on alert. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That makes sense. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to avoid sleeping tablets as a first step. Cut the coffee to two cups, none after noon, and swap the wine for a non-alcoholic wind-down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's going to be hard. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I know. I'd also like to give you a short course of a mild sleeping tablet, zopiclone, 3.75 mg, at night for five nights."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it addictive? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not in five nights, but we keep it short on purpose. Don't drive the next morning if you feel drowsy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like you to book a review with your own GP this week, to talk about the work stress and plan the next steps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll print the information sheet for you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you both. ~"
  }
 ],
